&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-492&quot;&gt;SCP-492&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Photographed Activity:&lt;/strong&gt; Helping researchers carry lab equipment.&lt;br /&gt;
