						 <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/250_logo.png" height="0" width="0" alt="250_logo.png" class="image" /></div> <div style="text-align: center; color: #600;"> <div class="unmargined"> <p>WARNING: THE FOUNDATION DATABASE IS</p> </div> <div class="unmargined" style="font-size: 400%; font-weight: bold; margin: 2px 0 5px;"> <p>CLASSIFIED</p> </div> <div class="unmargined"> <p>ACCESS BY UNAUTHORIZED PERSONNEL IS STRICTLY PROHIBITED<br /> PERPETRATORS WILL BE TRACKED, LOCATED, AND DETAINED</p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel centered standalone"></div> <div class="textchange"> <div class="sitemember"> <p style="text-align: center;">⚠️ Trouble logging in? See <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/third-party-cookies">Fixing Logins on Chrome and Edge</a> ⚠️</p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel centered standalone"> <p><span style="font-size:x-large;">Winners in the <strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/canon-renaissance-contest">Canon Renaissance Contest</a></strong> have been announced!</span></p> <p>See all entries on the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/canon-renaissance-contest">contest hub</a>, or read a random one:</p> </div> <div class="feature-block"> <div class="content-panel left-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Featured SCP Article</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5721">SCP-5721: What Passes As Worship In The Digital Age</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cerastes" >Cerastes</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>SCP-5721 is the collective designation for anomalous phenomena associated with Discord…</em></p> <p>(Featured by Karakatt and Cerastes)</p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/featured-scp-archive-ii">Featured SCP Archive</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel right-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Featured Tale</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-terrible-thing">A Terrible Thing</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann" >Riemann</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>The freak comes last. He is larger than the rest. He wears no parka.</em></p> <p>(Featured by Naveil, Riemann, and YellowISlol)</p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/featured-tale-archive-ii">Featured Tale Archive</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel left-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Featured GoI Format Document</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/critter-profile-bakugo">Critter Profile: Bakugo!</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" >Ihp</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>Bakugo is a bit standoffish, but he'll eagerly eat an apple out of your hand— or a nightmare out of your brain.</em></p> <p>(Featured by Truc Linh)</p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/featured-goi-format-archive">Featured GoI Format Archive</a></p> </div> </div> <div class="content-panel right-column"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Reviewers' Spotlight: <em>caspian2</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="feature-title"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5610">SCP-5610: To Put a Cat on Your Head</a></p> </div> <div class="feature-subtitle"> <p>by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" >Veralta</a></span></p> </div> <p><em>Approximately 56 percent of Japan's population has been found to have an instance of SCP-5610 resting atop of their head.</em></p> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/reviewers-spotlight-archive">Reviewers' Spotlight Archive</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div class="news-block content-panel"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>News</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>August 27, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p>Another site contest on the SCP Wiki is open for entering - go check out the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/canon-renaissance-contest">Canon Renaissance Contest</a>!</p> </div> </div> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>May 1, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p>The SCP Wiki's new site contest is open for entering - go check out the <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/exquisite-corpse-contest">Exquisite Corpse Contest</a>!</p> </div> </div> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>April 19, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p>The Wanderer's Library's new site contest is open for posting - go check out the <a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/wanderers-depths-contest">Wanderer's Depths</a>!</p> </div> </div> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>April 1, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p>A number of articles changed their seasonal colors for April Fool's Day and turned into <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/april-fools-2020">Super Cool Plants</a> entries.</p> </div> </div> <div class="alternate unmargined"> <div class="news-title"> <p>March 29, 2020</p> </div> <div class="news-content"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/144-hour-jam-contest-two">144-Hour Jam Contest Two</a> has come to a close! Nearly two hundred contest entries were submitted over the course of six days!</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/archived-news">Archived News</a></p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="international-block content-panel"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>Official Sister Sites</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/SerpHand.png" alt="SerpHand.png" class="image" /> <a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/system:join">The Wanderers Library</a> &#8212; Fiction From Another World.</div> <div class="international-description"> <p>The Wanderers Library is the Foundation's sister site and features the endless stories contained within the Library, home to the Serpents Hand and readers of all shapes and sizes.</p> </div> <div class="international-footer"> <p>Admins: &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" >Rounderhouse</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rumetzen" >rumetzen</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p> </p> </div> </div> <div class="international-block content-panel"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>SCP International</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/int.png" alt="int.png" class="image" /> <a href="http://scp-int.wikidot.com/">SCP-INT</a> &#8212; International Translation Archive</div> <div class="international-description"> <p>A gathering place for the International Community of the SCP Foundation</p> </div> <div class="international-footer"> <p>Admins: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-grym" >Dr Grym</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-grom" >Dr_Grom</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p> </p> </div> </div> <div class="international-block content-panel"> <div class="panel-heading"> <p>International Sites</p> </div> <div class="panel-body"> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/ru.png" alt="ru.png" class="image" /> <a href="http://scp-ru.wikidot.com/">SCP-RU</a> &#8212; SCP Foundation (Russian Branch)</div> <div class="international-description"> <p>Russian Counterpart! Translation available <strong><a href="http://translate.google.ca/translate?hl=en&amp;sl=ru&amp;tl=en&amp;u=http%3A%2F%2Fscp-ru.wikidot.com%2F">here</a></strong>.<br /> The Russian site is the oldest of the translation sites active on the web.</p> </div> <div class="international-footer"> <p>Admins: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gene-r" >Gene R</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/osobist" >Osobist</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/resure" >Resure</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/kr.png" alt="kr.png" class="image" /> <a href="http://ko.scp-wiki.net/">SCP-KO</a> &#8212; SCP 재단</div> <div class="international-description"> <p>Our Korean Colleagues! Translation available <strong><a href="http://translate.google.com/translate?sl=ko&amp;tl=en&amp;js=n&amp;prev=_t&amp;hl=en&amp;ie=UTF-8&amp;layout=2&amp;eotf=1&amp;u=http%3A%2F%2Fscpkoreahq.wikidot.com%2F">here</a></strong>.</p> </div> <div class="international-footer"> <p>Admins: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/salamander724" >Salamander724</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qaz135" >QAZ135</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shfoakdls" >shfoakdls</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/cn.png" alt="cn.png" class="image" /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/">SCP-CN</a> &#8212; SCP基金会</div> <div class="international-description"> <p>Our Chinese Bra