efioo9" >Mefioo9</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wanna-amigo" >wanna-amigo</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-blackpeace" >Dr_Blackpeace</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/es.png" alt="es.png" class="image" /> <a href="http://lafundacionscp.wikidot.com/">SCP-ES</a> &#8212; La Fundación SCP</div> <div class="international-description"> <p>The Spanish Branch! Translation available <strong><a href="http://translate.google.com/translate?hl=en&amp;sl=es&amp;tl=en&amp;u=http%3A%2F%2Flafundacionscp.wikidot.com%2F&amp;sandbox=1">here</a></strong>!</p> </div> <div class="international-footer"> <p>Admins: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-merlin-vi" >Dr Merlin - VI</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dc-yerko" >Dc_Yerko</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/th.png" alt="th.png" class="image" /> <a href="http://scp-th.wikidot.com/">SCP-TH</a> &#8212; สถาบัน SCP</div> <div class="international-description"> <p>The Thai Translators! Translation available <strong><a href="http://translate.google.com/translate?hl=en&amp;sl=th&amp;tl=en&amp;u=http%3A%2F%2Fscp-th.wikidot.com%2F&amp;sandbox=1">here</a></strong>!</p> </div> <div class="international-footer"> <p>Admins: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drsss" >DrSSS</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/slang" >Slang</a></span> &#8212; <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kuruni" >Kuruni</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.