w.wikidot.com/user:info/slashannemoo" >slashannemoo</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div class="international-entry"> <div class="international-title"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/main/cz.png" alt="cz.png" class="image" /> <a href="http://scp-cs.wikidot.com/">SCP-CZ</a> &#8212; SCP Nadace</div> <div class="international-description"> <p>Our Czech Companions! Translation available <strong><a href="http://translate.google.com/translate?hl=en&amp;sl=cs&amp;tl=en&amp;u=http%3A%2F%2Fscp-cs.wikidot.com%2F&amp;sandbox=1">here</a></strong>!</p> </div> <div class="international-footer"> <p>Admins: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hawkeyevole" >HawkeyeVole</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel-footer"> <p> </p> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:90%;">The SCP Foundation Wiki <strong>Sigma-9</strong> theme and style was designed by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aelanna" >Aelanna</a></span>,<br /> and used under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 license (<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/">CC-BY-SA</a>).<br /></span></p> <p><iframe src="http://www.scpwiki.com/main/html/b1d22cc85b51d15945223af54b75485a71d34523-12791623151443576353" allowtransparency="true" frameborder="0" class="html-block-iframe"></iframe></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-administrator" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=169306&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606531200" alt="The Administrator" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=169306)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-administrator" >The Administrator</a></span></p> 
