						 <div style="display: none"></div> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="info-container"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong>SCP-8839-J</strong> - <em>Turning on Light Mode to own the Libs.</em></p> <hr /> <p>Uh oh oh god kill it.</p> <p><strong>Image Credits:</strong><br /> 1. <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Satellite_image_of_bushfire_smoke_over_Eastern_Australia_(December_2019).jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Satellite_image_of_bushfire_smoke_over_Eastern_Australia_(December_2019).jpg</a>, by European Space Agency, CC BY-SA 2.0 &lt;<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0">https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0</a>&gt;, via Wikimedia Commons</p> <p>2.<a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Trinity_Detonation_T%26B.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Trinity_Detonation_T%26B.jpg</a> by United States Department of Energy, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons</p> <p>3. <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_large_blank_world_map_with_oceans_marked_in_blue.PNG">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_large_blank_world_map_with_oceans_marked_in_blue.PNG</a>, edits by me.</p> <hr /></div> <hr /> <div id="u-author_block"> <p style="text-align: center;">[{$authorPage} ▸ More by this Author ◂]</p> <hr /></div> <div class="translation_block"> <h1><span>Translations:</span></h1> </div> <div class="u-faq"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/component:info-ayers">F.A.Q.</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="border:solid 1px #999999; background:#E9E7CC; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 10px;"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h4><span>NOTICE FROM THE FOUNDATION RECORDS AND INFORMATION SECURITY ADMINISTRATION</span></h4> <p>WARNING. THIS ARTICLE CONCERNS A CLASS Φ COGNITOHAZARD. LOOKING AT THIS COGNITOHAZARD WILL KILL YOU. DO NOT LOOK AT IT. YOU WILL DIE.</p> <p>&#8212; Maria Jones, Director, RAISA</p> </div> </div> <div class="anom-bar-container item-8839-J clear-6 esoteric apollyon amida critical {$american}"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item">Item#:</span> <span class="number">8839-J</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level">Level6</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category">Containment Class:</div> <div class="class-text">esoteric</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category">Secondary Class:</div> <div class="class-text">apollyon</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category">Disruption Class:</div> <div class="class-text">amida</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category">Risk Class:</div> <div class="class-text">critical</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/classification-committee-memo">link to memo</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:50%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-8839-j/hell.jpeg"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-8839-j/hell.jpeg/medium.jpg" style="width:50%;" alt="hell.jpeg" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:50%;"> <p>Satellite image of Australia after SCP-8839-J was activated in Site 102.</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> Due to the nature of the anomaly, SCP-8839-J can be accessed from any foundation computer. Any attempt to access SCP-8839-J, however, is grounds for immediate termination in the most painful way possible. Any accidental activation of SCP-8839-J is grounds for the total deletion of all matter within 100km of the breach point. Any individual that survives SCP-8839-J is <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">to be afforded Class F amnestics</span> to be put out of their misery.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-8839-J is the 'light theme' for foundation messaging system 'SCiPNET'. Whatever entity or force of nature created SCP-8839 is, according to foundation analysis, in-human, and is likely more powerful and more evil than every other object in and out of containment, combined. SCP-8839-J is the most dangerous cognitohazard ever discovered, and as such is considered a &quot;Class Φ Cognitohazrd&quot;<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-145470-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>, the only of its kind. According to the SCPF IT help desk &quot;SCP-8839-J can be activated by clicking the <tt><strong>Cognitohazard - Automatic Removal</strong></tt> button on your SCiPNET terminal, scrolling to <tt><strong>Cognitohazard - Automatic Removal</strong></tt> and clicking the button 'light theme'&quot;.</p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><tt><strong>ADDENDA</strong></tt></span></p> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;I.&nbsp;Effects&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;SCP-8839-J&nbsp;event</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:50%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-8839-j/effect.jpeg"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-8839-j/effect.jpeg/medium.jpg" style="width:50%;" alt="effect.jpeg" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:50%;"> <p>Mushroom cloud above Site 19 after 1 microsecond of exposure to SCP-8839-J.</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>Within 10 metres:</strong> After the activation of SCP-8839-J, an affected terminal will become the most dangerous object within any foundation site. Whichever poor soul activates the cognitohazard will, in less than a one-millionth of a second, be bathed in an infinitely bright whiter than white light emerging from the affected terminal. The anomalous weight of the aberrations web design is such that a localised CK Class 'Reality Failure' occurs. This causes the individual who activated the anomaly to have their essence torn asunder, and thrown uncaringly into every great and terrible realm for its punishment. A wall of energy emerges from the bowels of reality itself, so horrible in its singularity that even the highest of beings avert their ever-watching eyes.</p> <p><strong>Within 10 kilometres</strong> Soon the wall of energy becomes too much, and reality itself elects to carpet bomb the thing into oblivion. The gods of the world, in a never-before-seen harmony, siphon energy to a safe location<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-145470-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup>. Many gods die in this process. The energy required to contain the blast soon causes several chain nuclear reactions, causing a blast of heat and a flash of unholy light. The heat of this light, approaching 987 quadrillion Kelvin, is such that all individuals within 10 kilometres are turned to glass then vaporised, their atoms being spread in an ever-expanding orb of plasma. No matter will remain from within this radius, but most individuals consider these victims to be the lucky few who die painlessly, who do not see everything they considered holy destroyed.</p> <p><strong>Within 50 kilometres:</strong> Those who happen to be facing towards the blast of SCP-8839-J are instantly and permanently blinded. A wave of heat spreads from the affected terminal, reaching temperatures of 2500 Kelvin. All flammable materials violently explode, and skin is turned to ash under the hungered maws of the blasts. A localised XK class &quot;Scorched Earth&quot; scenario occurs on the skin of nearby individuals, and all the unlucky bastards who had their mouths open at the time have their lungs burned from the inside of their mouths, their alveoli shattering and ribcage rupturing. Following this, a wave of pressure is emitted from the nexus of the anomaly, crushing houses like toothpicks, sending trees into the atmosphere, and turning windows into a primordial hoard of dust and fine sand, ripping the skin from any living thing nearby. Ever larger winds of hellfire pass over the buried corpses and survivors alike, burning them to cinders and releasing their remains in an ever-present wave of ash.</p> <p><strong>Within 210 Kilometres:</strong> The shockwave loses power over time, but as the event lures one to look through the window and at the second sun over the horizon, many are killed when their windows release snow of smaller shards. Those who survive this are not off the hook yet, however, as they are forced to move into the ruins and sift through the rubble for survivors. 100% of individuals who survive the atrocities and subsequent nuclear holocaust know one person who didn't, and soon after, a wave of non-anomalous suicides occur from those who are rightfully fed up by the whole ordeal.</p> <p><strong>Following the disaster:</strong> Nearby hospitals and medical facilities are overwhelmed from several million new, urgent injuries, and as such many more die. Firestorms fill all nearby cities, destroying survivors. Rescue operatives find themselves unable to enter the city as uplift from the heat causes crashes all over the world. The amount of material spewed into the atmosphere from the explosion invariably leads to an 8-year nuclear winter. Agriculture and tourism industries collapse, and whichever state the event occurs in descends into anarchism <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">and communism</span>.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;II.&nbsp;Testing&nbsp;Log</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"><br /> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>Procedure</th> <th>Results</th> <th>Notes</th> </tr> <tr> <td>Light mode test in Tech Site 34</td> <td>Chicxulub Crater, Mexico</td> <td><em>Unintentional Test. Determined to be in reasonable safety limits for foundation staff.</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Testing with Small Screen (iPhone) and Large Screen (MacBook Air)</td> <td>Larger screen produced more waves of GOD ALMIGHTY. Both resulted in an excess of 78 million casualties.</td> <td><em>Request to discontinue testing has been denied. The stated reason for this is &quot;Fuck you we're scientists, not the ethics committee.&quot;</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Mass simultaneous testing in Madagascar</td> <td>Madagascar instantaneously destroyed.</td> <td><em>Significant calls for monetary compensation of those who lost their homes in the <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">destruction</span> deletion of Madagascar.</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td>Mass simultaneous testing in Brazil</td> <td>See updated world map.</td> <td><em>Can't be too sure in science!</em> - Dr Bright.</td> </tr> </table> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-8839-j/mapzone.jpg" style="width:300px;" class="enlarge" alt="mapzone.jpg" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>Updated world map. Hover to enlarge.</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <p>Testing suspended after 'unacceptable casualties' under a unanimous decision of the ethics committee. Fucking bureaucrats.</p> <p>As foundation efforts have caused large amounts of ecological and civilian disruption, maintenance of the veil became utmost priority. Foundation efforts explain massive alterations as the result of deforestation campaigns, accidental nuclear destruction and 'sudden tectonic activity'. Public perception of World Leaders drops to 0% following these efforts.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;III.&nbsp;Interview&nbsp;Log</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Dr Frederick Jones</p> <p><strong>Interviewee:</strong> Dr Anna Jameson</p> <p><strong>Foreword:</strong> Psychiatric examination conducted on Dr Anna Jameson (23, Female) after she professed her enjoyment of SCP-8839-J over the <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">dark theme</span> regular theme. This occurred due to the clear denial of objective facts by this researcher suggesting that she was a) delusional, b) unserious, or c) possibly infected with an unknown memetic agent(s).</p> </blockquote> <hr /> <blockquote> <p><strong>&lt;BEGIN LOG&gt;</strong></p> <p><em>Dr Jameson and Dr Jones are separated by a glass partition, in order to protect from possible memetic agents. Dr Jameson is restrained with handcuffs.</em></p> <p><strong>Dr Jameson:</strong> So uhh&#8230; Dr Jameson&#8230; did you - uh - handcuff me to the chair because I like SCiPNET light theme? <em>[pauses]</em> If so&#8230; I'll probably have to report that to our superiors&#8230; bud.</p> <p><strong>Dr Jones:</strong> Wow&#8230; there it is - yikes, you're fucking infected. How can you be so dumb, you dipshit? The interview is on the order of the O5 council, you fuckass&#8230;<em>[sighs]</em> smooth-brain ass dickball. Do you realise how many people died from SCP-8839-J? <em>[yelling]</em> DO. YOU. REALISE?</p> <p><strong>Dr Jameson:</strong> What the fuck? No ones died - wait&#8230; <em>[laughs]</em> are you calling the light theme an SCP? Oh my god. Did I fall into a coma and wake up on April fools?</p> <p><strong>Dr Jones:</strong> YOU. ARE. SUFFERING. FROM. A. FUCKING. DELUSION. Do you hear me? Do ya'? I hope you fucking die - in fact, I'd happily kill you right now.</p> <p><strong>Dr Jameson:</strong> Woah&#8230; dude. This isn't funny. Please stop.</p> <p><strong>Dr Jones:</strong> Do you think this is a joke? Do ya'? I'll give you something to laugh at&#8230; I'll show you just how bad this fucking thing is.</p> <p><em>Dr Jones calls his superiors.</em></p> <p><strong>Dr Jones:</strong> Hello? Yeah&#8230; Jamesons infected. Permission to demonstrate SCP-8839-J? <em>[pauses]</em> Uh-huh. <em>[pauses]</em> Okay. Whatever you say, boss. I'll do it now.</p> <p><em>Dr Jones types into his terminal. He pushes <tt><strong>Cognitohazard - Automatic Removal</strong></tt>, and prepares to activate SCP-8839-J. He activates the anomaly and a wave of HOLY SHIT<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-145470-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup> emerges from his screen. Contact with Site-17 is lost.</em></p> </blockquote> <hr /></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doggol" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6991250&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606531201" alt="Doggol" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6991250)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doggol" >Doggol</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-145470-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. A cognitohazard which proves objectively that life is worthless, illogical, and disgusting.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-145470-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. Namely Detriot, Michigan</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-145470-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. Technical Term for the colour emitted by SCP-8839-J. In comparison, White looks black.</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
